#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# six_j_symbol

#% text
# `six_j_symbol([j1, j2, j3], [j4, j5, j6])` gives Wigner's 6j symbol by Racah's formula, exact; zero unless the four triples satisfy the triangle conditions.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
six_j_symbol([1, 2, 3], [2, 1, 2])
#% output
#= (1/105)*21^(1/2)

#% cell
six_j_symbol([1/2, 1/2, 1], [5/2, 7/2, 3])
#% output
#= (-1/21)*21^(1/2)

#% cell
six_j_symbol([1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 12])
#% output
#= 0

